<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Beranda | Toko Seni Gypsum' }) %>
</head>
<body class="bg-white font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-ink antialiased">

    <%- include('partials/header', { active: 'beranda' }) %>

    <main>
        <!-- Hero -->
        <section class="bg-sage py-14 sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
            <div class="mx-auto grid w-[min(100%-3rem,70rem)] items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2">
                <div>
                    <p class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-brand">
                        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-dot"></span>
                        Asisten belanja yang selalu siap
                    </p>
                    <h1 class="mb-6 max-w-[11ch] font-display text-5xl font-normal leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-brand-dark sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
                        Cari bahan bangunan jadi <em class="text-brand">lebih mudah.</em>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="max-w-[44ch] text-muted">Kenali prototipe chatbot Toko Seni Gypsum: teman praktis untuk menemukan produk, memahami pemasangan, dan mendapatkan jawaban dengan cepat.</p>
                    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
                        <a class="rounded border border-brand bg-brand px-6 py-3 text-[.95rem] font-semibold text-white no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-brand-dark" href="/bantuan">Tanya asisten &rarr;</a>
                        <a class="font-medium text-brand-dark underline underline-offset-4" href="#produk">Lihat katalog produk</a>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted">
                        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-dot"></span>
                        Dirancang untuk kebutuhan pelanggan Toko Seni Gypsum
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Ilustrasi percakapan chatbot -->
                <div class="w-full max-w-md justify-self-center rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_18px_40px_-18px_rgba(20,61,46,.35)]" aria-label="Contoh percakapan chatbot">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-line pb-4">
                        <span class="grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-brand text-sm font-bold text-white">G</span>
                        <div>
                            <strong class="block text-sm leading-snug">Asisten Gypsum</strong>
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-muted"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-dot"></span>Siap membantu</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="ml-auto tracking-widest text-muted" aria-hidden="true">&middot;&middot;&middot;</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="my-4 text-center text-[.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8a968e]">Hari ini, 09.41</p>
                    <div class="mb-2 max-w-[88%] rounded-lg bg-paper px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[.8rem] leading-normal">Halo! Sedang mencari bahan untuk proyek plafon?</div>
                    <div class="mb-2 ml-auto max-w-[88%] rounded-lg bg-brand px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[.8rem] leading-normal text-white">Apa saja yang dibutuhkan untuk memasang plafon gypsum?</div>
                    <div class="mb-2 max-w-[88%] rounded-lg bg-paper px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[.8rem] leading-normal">Umumnya Anda memerlukan papan gypsum, rangka hollow, sekrup, dan kompon. Saya bisa bantu jelaskan satu per satu.</div>
                    <div class="mb-4 mt-3.5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <span class="rounded-full border border-line px-3 py-1 text-xs text-brand-dark">Daftar produk</span>
                        <span class="rounded-full border border-line px-3 py-1 text-xs text-brand-dark">Panduan pasang</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded border border-line py-2 pl-3.5 pr-2 text-[.78rem] text-[#8a968e]">
                        <span>Tulis pesan...</span>
                        <span class="grid h-6 w-6 place-items-center rounded-[3px] bg-brand text-white" aria-hidden="true">&uarr;</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-center text-[.65rem] text-[#8a968e]">Ilustrasi percakapan chatbot</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Fitur -->
        <section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-20" id="fitur">
            <div class="mx-auto w-[min(100%-3rem,70rem)]">
                <div class="mb-12 grid items-end gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
                    <div>
                        <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-brand">Melayani dengan lebih siap</p>
                        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-normal leading-[1.12] tracking-tight text-brand-dark sm:text-[2.6rem]">
                            <span class="inline-block border-b border-line pb-2">Satu asisten, banyak bantuan.</span>
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="max-w-[42ch] text-sm text-muted">Informasi penting tersedia dalam satu percakapan, dari memilih produk sampai memulai pemasangan.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid divide-y divide-line border-y border-line md:grid-cols-2 md:divide-y-0 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:divide-x">
                    <article class="px-6 pb-8 pt-7 md:border-b md:border-line lg:border-b-0">
                        <span class="mb-4 block text-[.7rem] text-[#8a968e]">01</span>
                        <span class="mb-4 grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#dfe9d8] text-sm text-brand-dark">&#9638;</span>
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold leading-snug">Informasi produk</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-[.82rem] text-muted">Kenali bahan dan perlengkapan seperti gypsum, hollow, serta cat yang tersedia.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="px-6 pb-8 pt-7 md:border-b md:border-l md:border-line lg:border-b-0 lg:border-l-0">
                        <span class="mb-4 block text-[.7rem] text-[#8a968e]">02</span>
                        <span class="mb-4 grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#f4e6da] text-sm text-brand-dark">&#8599;</span>
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold leading-snug">Panduan pemasangan</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-[.82rem] text-muted">Dapatkan gambaran kebutuhan dan langkah dasar untuk pengerjaan plafon gypsum.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="px-6 pb-8 pt-7">
                        <span class="mb-4 block text-[.7rem] text-[#8a968e]">03</span>
                        <span class="mb-4 grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#dde8ea] text-sm text-brand-dark">&#9719;</span>
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold leading-snug">Jawaban lebih cepat</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-[.82rem] text-muted">Chatbot membantu menjawab pertanyaan umum tanpa harus menunggu staf tersedia.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="px-6 pb-8 pt-7 md:border-l md:border-line lg:border-l-0">
                        <span class="mb-4 block text-[.7rem] text-[#8a968e]">04</span>
                        <span class="mb-4 grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#f3e3de] text-sm text-brand-dark">&#10003;</span>
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold leading-snug">Bantuan pemesanan</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-[.82rem] text-muted">Mulai percakapan pemesanan dengan informasi yang lebih jelas dan terarah.</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Produk (data dari backend) -->
        <section class="bg-paper py-14 sm:py-20" id="produk">
            <div class="mx-auto w-[min(100%-3rem,70rem)]">
                <div class="mb-12 grid items-end gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
                    <div>
                        <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-brand">Katalog toko</p>
                        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-normal leading-[1.12] tracking-tight text-brand-dark sm:text-[2.6rem]">
                            <span class="inline-block border-b border-line pb-2">Produk tersedia.</span>
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="max-w-[42ch] text-sm text-muted">Daftar ini diambil langsung dari backend, sama dengan data di endpoint <a class="text-brand" href="/api/produk" target="_blank">/api/produk</a>.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
                    <% produkList.forEach(function(produk) { %>
                        <article class="flex flex-col rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-white p-[1.4rem]">
                            <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between">
                                <span class="rounded-full bg-sage px-3 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-dark"><%= produk.category %></span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-[#8a968e]">ID <%= produk.id %></span>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-medium text-brand-dark"><%= produk.name %></h3>
                            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted"><%= produk.spec %></p>
                            <p class="mt-auto pt-5 font-bold text-brand"><%= formatRupiah(produk.price) %></p>
                            <a class="mt-3 text-[.82rem] font-semibold text-brand-dark underline underline-offset-4" href="/bantuan?produk=<%= produk.id %>">Tanya produk ini &rarr;</a>
                        </article>
                    <% }); %>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Tentang -->
        <section class="bg-sage py-14 sm:py-20" id="tentang">
            <div class="mx-auto grid w-[min(100%-3rem,70rem)] items-center gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12">
                <div>
                    <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-brand">Tentang proyek</p>
                    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-normal leading-[1.12] tracking-tight text-brand-dark sm:text-[2.6rem]">Dibangun dengan Express.js dan EJS.</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="max-w-[48ch] text-muted md:border-l md:border-brand/25 md:pl-8">Prototipe ini dikembangkan sebagai studi kasus <%= shop.name %>. Halaman dirender oleh server dengan arsitektur MVC, di-styling dengan Tailwind CSS, dan datanya dilayani lewat endpoint API.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <%- include('partials/chat-fab') %>

</body>
</html>
